a del compositore aumenterà ancora di più con la composizione del Nabucco nel 1842."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"The life and loves of great composer Giuseppe Verdi are played against a background of the great operas of the 19th Century. A tender love story of his successful and turbulent life, with more than 20 excerpts from his acclaimed operas."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vWBEFvPEAyqgsv92OAxJACSqlQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gRtrqQJfViIELpUPVcWRamfUQ0a.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":149479,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vWBEFvPEAyqgsv92OAxJACSqlQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2vWBEFvPEAyqgsv92OAxJACSqlQ.jpg","language":"it","width":512,"height":768},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2vWBEFvPEAyqgsv92OAxJACSqlQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2vWBEFvPEAyqgsv92OAxJACSqlQ.jpg","language":"it","width":512,"height":768},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gkei03Z7jqkrIKZZlxy5gmRffM8.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gkei03Z7jqkrIKZZlxy5gmRffM8.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AbMOjlq1SnxtEprJ88ArRtNFs3Q.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbMOjlq1SnxtEprJ88ArRtNFs3Q.jpg","language":"it","width":655,"height":982},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/556DTBuHJsaTo2YX6F2TLoBgZ6S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/556DTBuHJsaTo2YX6F2TLoBgZ6S.jpg","language":"it","width":1009,"height":1514}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uEDZ7x1oVvu1NJS42MUje7ybFsW.jpg","previewUr